[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3247234391","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110214#issuecomment-3247234391","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110214","id":3247234391,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BjN1X","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-03T00:29:12Z","updated_at":"2025-09-03T00:29:12Z","body":"The Run Instances dialog likely needs to be modified to reload the file every time the dialog shows up, so that it obeys external changes.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3247234391/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3247241672","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110214#issuecomment-3247241672","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110214","id":3247241672,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BjPnI","user":{"login":"Selkcip","id":6801403,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MDE0MDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6801403?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip","html_url":"https://github.com/Selkcip","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-03T00:33:59Z","updated_at":"2025-09-03T00:33:59Z","body":"> The Run Instances dialog likely needs to be modified to reload the file every time the dialog shows up, so that it obeys external changes.\n\nThe bigger issue is that the editor does not use the modified value when running the game. If `multiple_instances_enabled` is false when the project is opened and then set to true via `set_project_metadata`, running from the editor still only launches a single instance of the game.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3247241672/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3249056583","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110214#issuecomment-3249056583","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110214","id":3249056583,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BqKtH","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-03T12:31:55Z","updated_at":"2025-09-03T12:33:10Z","body":"That's not a bug. Project metadata is used internally and gives no guarantee that modifying it yourself will work as you expect.\n\nThe proper way to do this is exposing a method that enables multiple instances. Or if you want to use hacks, find the CheckBox in the scene tree and toggle it from code.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3249056583/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3250407213","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110214#issuecomment-3250407213","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110214","id":3250407213,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BvUct","user":{"login":"Selkcip","id":6801403,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MDE0MDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6801403?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip","html_url":"https://github.com/Selkcip","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Selkcip/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-03T18:58:47Z","updated_at":"2025-09-03T18:59:46Z","body":"Does GDScript's `EditorSettings.set_project_metadata` not call the same C++ implementation that the run instances dialog does? If it does I would expect it to have the same result as it does not appear to explicitly reload the metadata afterwards. \n\n```\nvoid RunInstancesDialog::_save_main_args() {\n\tProjectSettings::get_singleton()->set_setting(\"editor/run/main_run_args\", main_args_edit->get_text());\n\tProjectSettings::get_singleton()->save();\n\tEditorSettings::get_singleton()->set_project_metadata(\"debug_options\", \"run_main_feature_tags\", main_features_edit->get_text());\n\tEditorSettings::get_singleton()->set_project_metadata(\"debug_options\", \"multiple_instances_enabled\", enable_multiple_instances_checkbox->is_pressed());\n}\n```\n\n```\nvoid EditorSettings::set_project_metadata(const String &p_section, const String &p_key, const Variant &p_data) {\n\tconst String path = _get_project_metadata_path();\n\n\tif (project_metadata.is_null()) {\n\t\tproject_metadata.instantiate();\n\n\t\tError err = project_metadata->load(path);\n\t\tif (err != OK && err != ERR_FILE_NOT_FOUND) {\n\t\t\tERR_PRINT(\"Cannot load project metadata from file '\" + path + \"'.\");\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\tproject_metadata->set_value(p_section, p_key, p_data);\n\n\tError err = project_metadata->save(path);\n\tERR_FAIL_COND_MSG(err != OK, \"Cannot save project metadata to file '\" + path + \"'.\");\n}\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3250407213/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3250426508","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110214#issuecomment-3250426508","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110214","id":3250426508,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BvZKM","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-03T19:04:07Z","updated_at":"2025-09-03T19:04:07Z","body":"It's the same method, but the dialog reads the metadata only once. It's not needed